<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK SIGNS DEAL WITH RUSSIAN BANK.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK SIGNS DEAL WITH RUSSIAN BANK.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Kredyt Bank SA and Moscow Joint Stock Commercial Bank Vozrozhdenyie have signed an agreement on cooperation in accounts management, Kredyt said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the banks were also considering cooperation in securities trade, syndicated loans and capital market operations.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
